WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.032 --> 00:00:09.349
"It's a perfect day for flying kites," Dad said.

2
00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:12.392
He took the kids' kites from the car.

3
00:00:12.393 --> 00:00:15.082
Oliver jumped up and down.

4
00:00:15.083 --> 00:00:19.731
"I can't wait to fly my kite!"

5
00:00:19.732 --> 00:00:27.685
Emmy groaned. "Flying kites is boring."

6
00:00:27.686 --> 00:00:34.661
Mom and Dad helped the kids launch their kites.

7
00:00:34.662 --> 00:00:40.334
Emmy gave a bored sigh.

8
00:00:40.335 --> 00:00:43.787
"Now what do we do?"

9
00:00:43.788 --> 00:00:48.958
"We have a balloon race," Mom said.

10
00:00:48.959 --> 00:00:54.758
"What's that?" Emmy asked.

11
00:00:54.759 --> 00:01:01.514
Mom just smiled and took some things from her bag.

12
00:01:01.515 --> 00:01:09.360
She blew up a red balloon.

13
00:01:09.361 --> 00:01:12.864
Then she picked up a twist tie.

14
00:01:12.865 --> 00:01:19.041
"I'll attach a paper clip to your balloon with this."

15
00:01:19.042 --> 00:01:25.540
Mom hooked the paper clip onto Emmy's kite string.

16
00:01:25.541 --> 00:01:29.754
"Hold on to the balloon," Mom said.

17
00:01:29.755 --> 00:01:35.235
She added balloons to the boys' kites.

18
00:01:35.236 --> 00:01:41.335
"When I say go, release your balloons," Mom said.

19
00:01:41.336 --> 00:01:46.849
"One, two, three . . . Go!"

20
00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:55.832
"Whoa!" Harry said. "The balloons are climbing the kite strings!"

21
00:01:55.833 --> 00:02:01.666
"The first balloon to reach its kite wins!" Mom said.

22
00:02:01.667 --> 00:02:05.733
Emmy held her breath as her balloon climbed higher.

23
00:02:05.734 --> 00:02:08.774
Oliver's balloon was slow.

24
00:02:08.775 --> 00:02:14.378
But Harry's balloon was even with Emmy's.

25
00:02:14.379 --> 00:02:19.291
"Come on, red balloon!" Emmy called.

26
00:02:19.292 --> 00:02:22.354
She kept watching the race.

27
00:02:22.355 --> 00:02:27.999
Then—her balloon went ahead!

28
00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:33.999
"I won!" Emmy shouted.

29
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:38.624
Now she was the one jumping up and down.

30
00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:50.640
"Let's race again!"

